### end token followed by a space and Windows line endings
cat <<DONE 
building
DONE
>>> SC1009 1:1
>>> SC1017 1:12
>>> SC1041 1:7
>>> SC1042 1:7
>>> SC1072 4:1
>>> SC1073 1:5

### end token with a suffix on its line
cat <<EOF
results below
EOF2
>>> SC1009 1:1
>>> SC1041 1:7
>>> SC1042 1:7
>>> SC1072 4:1
>>> SC1073 1:5

### end token in the middle of a body line
mail -s report admin <<END
see the END of the log
>>> SC1009 1:1
>>> SC1041 1:24
>>> SC1042 1:24
>>> SC1072 3:1
>>> SC1073 1:22

